## Our SEO Process

Before any modifications are carried out, an understanding of the site is crucial. The entire process is set up to ensure that opportunities are uncovered, the areas that matter most are worked on, and that a strategy is regularly tweaked.

### 1. Website & SEO Audit

We’ll first run a full website audit (covering technical errors, indexing issues, keyword and content deficiencies, on-page factors, internal linking strategy, and so on) in order to gain a holistic view of how your website is currently performing in organic searches.

### 2. Keyword Research

We look for relevant keywords which reflect what someone is searching, why they’re searching it, the level of competition to rank for it, your business’ relevance, and it's potential commercial intent (e.g. Does this suggest someone is looking to buy a product or service?).

Using industry-specific phrases, for instance, if a company specializes in selling in Noida then using terms like SEO Company in Noida, SEO Agency in Noida and SEO Services in Noida will surely work along with other industry-specific phrases to find users closer to a point of conversion.

### 3. Competitor Analysis

To compete with others sites we look at which keywords they target. The organisation of pages; links; technology and any weak points that our sites may have or our clients could develop further to our benefit .

### 4. On-Page Optimization

We optimize important website elements including:

- Page titles
- Meta descriptions
- Headings
- Content structure
- URLs
- Internal links
- Image optimization
- Search intent alignment
- Schema markup where appropriate

### 5. Technical SEO

Our **technical SEO services in Noida** focus on making your website easier for search engines to crawl, understand, and index.

We can work on areas such as:

- Crawlability
- Indexation
- Website architecture
- XML sitemap
- Robots.txt
- Canonical URLs
- Broken links
- Core Web Vitals
- Mobile usability
- Redirects
- Duplicate content issues
- Structured data

### 6. Content Optimization

Our SEO content should not only fully satisfy user's query but also be perceived as relevant and authoritative. We help optimize the already existing content as well as detect potential new pages based on keyword intent and audience you are targeting.

### 7. Authority & Link Building

Relevant and authoritative backlinks may be advantageous to develop your website. We believe in a quality, topical and genuine backlinking profile as opposed to quantity on an off page SEO approach.

### 8. Tracking & Continuous Optimization

An SEO agency continues work on the project long-term. You should be assessing performance indicators such as position, traffic, conversions, indexability etc, in order to be able to conclude what is going well and what could be done more.

